# Matching an equality statement
#
# An N3 equality statement connects two names. Eyeron exposes it as
# owl:sameAs, allowing a forward rule to recognize the statement and derive
# the test result.

@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix : <http://example.org/socrates#> .

:X = :Y .

{
    :X owl:sameAs :Y
} => {
    :test :is true
} .
